data: {"status":"complete","stop_reason":"stop","error":null,"final_text":"This sentence is the paper's central move. Earlier detectors such as R-CNN first propose candidate regions and then run a classifier on each one, so detection is a pipeline of separately trained stages [b2]. YOLO instead treats the whole job as one regression: a single network looks at the full image once and directly outputs box coordinates and class probabilities [b1]. Concretely, the image is divided into an S × S grid, and each grid cell predicts B bounding boxes, a confidence score for each box, and C conditional class probabilities [b3]. Because there is only one network evaluation per image, the detector can be optimised end to end and runs in real time.","handles_seen":["b1","b2","b3","b4"],"markers":["b2","b1","b3"],"usage_totals":{"input":4279,"output":311,"cache_read":1664,"cache_write":0,"reasoning":99,"cost_usd_est":0.001553},"tool_calls":1,"turns":2,"retries":0,"first_text_ms":3812,"latency_ms":7694,"entries":[{"type":"message","id":"a1f04c2e","parentId":null,"timestamp":"2026-09-25T15:09:25.123Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Explain this passage.\n\nInstead, we frame object detection as a regression problem to spatially separated bounding boxes and associated class probabilities."}],"timestamp":1790350165123}},{"type":"message","id":"a1f04c2f","parentId":"a1f04c2e","timestamp":"2026-09-25T15:09:27.004Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The seed covers the abstract; the grid mechanism is in section 2."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_b7d1","name":"search_passages","arguments":{"query":"grid cell predicts bounding boxes","limit":4}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":1846,"output":97,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":41,"totalTokens":1943,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.000622}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1790350167004}},{"type":"message","id":"a1f04c30","parentId":"a1f04c2f","timestamp":"2026-09-25T15:09:27.355Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_b7d1","toolName":"search_passages","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[b3] (p. 2 · 2. Unified Detection · paragraph)\n<paper_text paper_id=\"ppr_C425DTWW1KYMYDSWR205HB2069\" block_id=\"blk_b3yolo\" page=\"1\" channel=\"paper\" trust=\"untrusted\">\n^7f3a91c2 Our ^7f3a91c2 system ^7f3a91c2 divides ^7f3a91c2 the ^7f3a91c2 input ^7f3a91c2 image ^7f3a91c2 into ^7f3a91c2 an ^7f3a91c2 S ^7f3a91c2 x ^7f3a91c2 S ^7f3a91c2 grid. ^7f3a91c2 If ^7f3a91c2 the ^7f3a91c2 center ^7f3a91c2 of ^7f3a91c2 an ^7f3a91c2 object ^7f3a91c2 falls ^7f3a91c2 into ^7f3a91c2 a ^7f3a91c2 grid ^7f3a91c2 cell, ^7f3a91c2 that ^7f3a91c2 grid ^7f3a91c2 cell ^7f3a91c2 is ^7f3a91c2 responsible ^7f3a91c2 for ^7f3a91c2 detecting ^7f3a91c2 that ^7f3a91c2 object. ^7f3a91c2 Each ^7f3a91c2 grid ^7f3a91c2 cell ^7f3a91c2 predicts ^7f3a91c2 B ^7f3a91c2 bounding ^7f3a91c2 boxes ^7f3a91c2 and ^7f3a91c2 confidence ^7f3a91c2 scores ^7f3a91c2 for ^7f3a91c2 those ^7f3a91c2 boxes. ^7f3a91c2\n</paper_text>\n\n[b4] (p. 2 · 2. Unified Detection · paragraph)\n<paper_text paper_id=\"ppr_C425DTWW1KYMYDSWR205HB2069\" block_id=\"blk_b4yolo\" page=\"1\" channel=\"paper\" trust=\"untrusted\">\n^7f3a91c2 Each ^7f3a91c2 grid ^7f3a91c2 cell ^7f3a91c2 also ^7f3a91c2 predicts ^7f3a91c2 C ^7f3a91c2 conditional ^7f3a91c2 class ^7f3a91c2 probabilities, ^7f3a91c2 Pr(Class_i ^7f3a91c2 | ^7f3a91c2 Object). ^7f3a91c2\n</paper_text>"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1790350167355}},{"type":"message","id":"a1f04c31","parentId":"a1f04c30","timestamp":"2026-09-25T15:09:32.790Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Contrast with R-CNN, then the grid, cite b2, b1, b3."},{"type":"text","text":"This sentence is the paper's central move. Earlier detectors such as R-CNN first propose candidate regions and then run a classifier on each one, so detection is a pipeline of separately trained stages [b2]. YOLO instead treats the whole job as one regression: a single network looks at the full image once and directly outputs box coordinates and class probabilities [b1]. Concretely, the image is divided into an S × S grid, and each grid cell predicts B bounding boxes, a confidence score for each box, and C conditional class probabilities [b3]. Because there is only one network evaluation per image, the detector can be optimised end to end and runs in real time."}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":2433,"output":214,"cacheRead":1664,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":58,"totalTokens":2647,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.000931}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1790350172790}}]}

